    {
      "scenario_id": "scen_delivery_stats",
      "name": "QuickRide Delivery — Descriptive Statistics",
      "summary": "QuickRide is a fictional last-mile delivery company operating in Lagos, Nigeria. An analyst characterises delivery-time performance across four city zones (Ikeja, Lekki, Surulere, Yaba) and three driver shifts (morning, afternoon, evening). The scenario supplies the seven-order batch from the teaching blocks (18, 20, 22, 22, 26, 28, 80 minutes) and a larger per-order table for hands-on work.",
