      "name": "QuickRide App — Checkout Button A/B Test",
      "summary": "QuickRide's product team runs a randomised A/B test on the ordering app's checkout button. The control group (A) sees the original button; the treatment group (B) sees a redesigned button. The metric compared is the share of users who complete an order (conversion rate). Control rate: 0.20 (20 %); treatment rate: 0.22 (22 %); lift: 10 %.",
